const strip = s => String(s ?? "").replace(/<[^>]+>/g," ").replace(/&amp;/g,"&").replace(/&lt;/g,"<").replace(/&gt;/g,">").replace(/&quot;/g,'"').replace(/&#39;/g,"'").replace(/\s+/g," ").trim();
